       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum daily dose.\n\n- **Per dose:** Single oral doses are usually capped at 800 mg.\n- **Per day:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day in monitored settings. Over-the-counter use is limited to 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, cardiovascular events, and fluid retention. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nThis may be a typo. Possible intended doses include:\n- 400 mg every 6 hours (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg every 6 hours (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nPlease tell me the dose and frequency you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is intended and that you've verified it. I'll enter the order once I have that."
